<div id="pf14" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="14"><div class="pc pc14 w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 y211 w3 h2b" alt="" src="bg14.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">5<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>网络层<span class="_ _56"> </span><span class="ff3">5.3<span class="_ _12"> </span></span>解决<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IPv4 </span>地址不足的主要技术</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y18d ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.2.2.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">提供信息的询问报文<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(Informational/Query<span class="_ _28"> </span>Messag<span class="_ _3"></span>es)</div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y18e ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">用于进行网络诊断或获取特定信息。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y18f ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">回送请求与应答报文<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Echo R<span class="_ _3"></span>equest<span class="_ _0"> </span>/<span class="_ _0"> </span>Echo<span class="_ _0"> </span>R<span class="_ _3"></span>eply)<span class="ff4">：用于测试目的站是否可达以及了解其有关状态。<span class="_ _33"></span><span class="ff2">（<span class="ff11">Ping</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h3 y190 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">命令的原理）</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1f1 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">时间戳请求与应<span class="_ _f"></span>答报文<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Timestamp<span class="_ _0"> </span>Req<span class="_ _3"></span>uest /<span class="_ _0"> </span>Timestamp<span class="_ _0"> </span>Repl<span class="_ _29"></span>y)<span class="ff4">：请<span class="_ _f"></span>某个主机或路由器回答当<span class="_ _f"></span>前的日期和</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1f2 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">时间，用于时钟同步和测量时间。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1f3 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">地址掩码请求与应答报文<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff6">(Address<span class="_ _8"> </span>Mask<span class="_ _0"> </span>R<span class="_ _29"></span>equest<span class="_ _0"> </span>/<span class="_ _8"> </span>A<span class="_ _3"></span>ddress<span class="_ _8"> </span>Mask<span class="_ _0"> </span>R<span class="_ _3"></span>eply)<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _2e"></span>主机在启动通过此报文获得本网</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1f4 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">的子网掩码。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y212 ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">5.3<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">解决<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>IPv4<span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff1">地址不足的主要技术</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y213 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">面对<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IPv4<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址枯竭的问题，主要有以下几种技术手段进行缓解或解决：</div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y214 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">无分类域间路由<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">CIDR</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y215 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">原理<span class="ff4">：消除了传统的<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">A</span>、<span class="ff3">B</span>、<span class="ff3">C<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>类地址划分，使用各<span class="_ _f"></span>种长度的“网络前缀”来代替分类地址中的<span class="_ _f"></span>网络</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y216 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">号和子网号。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y217 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：可以更加有效地分配<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址空间，减少了地址的浪费。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y218 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">网络地址转换<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">NA<span class="_ _4"></span>T</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y219 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">原理<span class="ff4">：将专用网络地址（私有<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP</span>，如<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">192.168.x.x</span>）转换为公用地址（公网<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y21a ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _29"></span>允许一个机构内部的<span class="ff1">多台</span>主机共享<span class="ff1">一个</span>全球唯一的公网<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IPv4 </span>地址上网，<span class="_ _29"></span>大大节省了公网<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>资</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y21b ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">源。</div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y21c ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">互联网协议第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">6<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>版<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">IPv6</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y21d ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">原理<span class="ff4">：将<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址长度从<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">32<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>位扩展到<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">128<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>位<span class="ff4">。即<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">8<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>个<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">16<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>位的二进制<span class="ff3">/8<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>个<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">4<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>位十六进制数表示。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y21e ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：提供了几乎无限的地址空间，是解决<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IPv4<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址耗尽问题的</span>根本措施<span class="ff4">。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y21f ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">动态主机配置协议<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">DHCP</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y220 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">原理<span class="ff4">：局域网的网络协议，使用<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">UDP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>协议工作。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y221 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _2c"></span>通过<span class="ff1">动态分配<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>地址，<span class="_ _2c"></span>使得不在线的主机不占用<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>地址，<span class="_ _4"></span>实现了地址的复用，<span class="_ _2c"></span>提高了<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y222 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">的利用率。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y223 ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">5.4<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">子网划分<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>(Subnetting)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y224 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.4.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">划分原理</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y225 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">子网划分的本质是<span class="_ _4"></span>“借位”<span class="_ _2"></span>，<span class="_ _2c"></span><span class="ff3">CIDR<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">使用<span class="_ _2c"></span><span class="ff1">“斜线记法”<span class="_ _57"></span><span class="ff4">，<span class="_ _2c"></span>即在<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>地址后面加上斜线，<span class="_ _2c"></span>斜线后的数字表示网络前</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x3 h7 y226 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">缀所占的位数。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y227 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">从主机号的高位借用<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑛<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>位作为子网号。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y228 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">借位后，网络结构变为三层：<span class="ff1">网络号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">-<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>子网号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">-<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>主机号</span>。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y229 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">剩余的主机位<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">ℎ<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>减少，导致每个子网容纳的主机数变少。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y22a ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.4.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">两类划分方法</span></div><div class="t m0 x81 h7 y22b ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">FLSM<span class="_ _0"> </span>(<span class="ff4">定长子网掩码</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y22c ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">网络中所有子网使用<span class="ff1">相同长度</span>的掩码。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y22d ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">优点是配置简单，缺点是<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址浪费严重（例如点对点链路也分配<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">/24</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x81 h7 y22e ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">VLSM<span class="_ _0"> </span>(<span class="ff4">变长子网掩码</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y22f ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">网络中不同子网可以使用<span class="ff1">不同长度</span>的掩码。</div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">15<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
